          "kicker": "Eligibility watch",
          "heading": "Fiji Rugby keeps watching Mark Nawaqanitawase's switch as Wallabies wait to year-end",
          "body": "Today's searches return headlines but no new statement on Mark Nawaqanitawase's eligibility. Fiji Rugby chief executive Koli Sewabu says the union is following a possible switch with interest, while Wallabies coach Les Kiss said: 'I'll wait until the end of the year to see where he sits.' The winger, with 11 Wallabies caps, is eligible for Fiji, Italy and Australia after a three-year stand-down, so Fiji's pitch stays open for the 2027 World Cup."
