          "kicker": "Club tragedy",
          "heading": "French prosecutors open probe into death of Lions lock Hyron Andrews",
          "body": "A French investigation is under way into the death of Hyron Andrews, 31, a lock with Johannesburg club Lions, who was found unresponsive at the team hotel on Île de Ré. La Rochelle prosecutor Arnaud Laraize confirmed the inquiry to AFP, and investigators are treating the case as a suspected accident, with an autopsy to follow. Lions will still play Saturday's Champions Cup match against La Rochelle, with a minute's silence before every Champions Cup and Challenge Cup match this weekend."
        },
