          "heading": "Munster name Avan Lee interim chief executive as Ian Flanagan steps down",
          "body": "Munster have named New Zealander Avan Lee as interim chief executive, a development first reported on 3 October, replacing Ian Flanagan, who is stepping down after recent criticism. Lee, a former Hurricanes chief executive, wants a role for Peter O'Mahony, according to reports. Munster confirmed Flanagan's departure in a statement, and because Lee's role is interim, the permanent succession remains open."
