          "heading": "Ben Thomas set to miss Wales's Nations Championship start with calf injury",
          "body": "Cardiff centre Ben Thomas is set to miss the start of Wales's Nations Championship with a calf injury, a blow for head coach Steve Tandy before the opening match against Japan. The 27-year-old, who has 19 caps, started at inside centre in the 43-0 defeat to South Africa in Durban in July. Cardiff head coach Corniel van Zyl said: \"He'll be able to definitely form part of the Nations Championship, but might not recover for the first or second game.\""
