          "body": "Shaun Edwards is now part of Argentina's coaching set-up as defence coach, a move that rules him out of a role in Steve Borthwick's set-up, as reported last week. The appointment is framed around a Rugby World Cup push in Australia, but the storyline stays open until Los Pumas play their first Test under his defensive system, with Ireland the next opponent. Nothing new on the appointment has broken in today's coverage, so the detail stands as last reported."
